<title>JAPAN: Dai-ichi Hotel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dai-ichi Hotel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.53		vs	   13.15</p>
<p> Operating     loss 1.72		vs     prft 1.55</p>
<p> Current	 loss 2.68		vs	prft 211 million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 2.82		vs	 prft 15 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 75.64 yen	  vs     prft 0.42 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     37 million	  vs	  37 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Dai-ichi Hotel Ltd operates business hotels.</p>
</text>
